479 - Tread Softly
 / 
Key: Bb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 479
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[Bb]Be silent, be silent, A [F]whisper is [Bb]heard,
Be [Eb]silent, and [Bb]listen, Oh, [F]trea[C7]sure each [F]wo[Bb]rd![F7]
[F7]Tread [Bb]softly, tread [Eb]softly, The [F]Mas[F7]ter is [Bb]here,
Tread [Eb]softly, tread [Bb]softly, He [F]bids [F7]us draw [Bb]near.

Refrain:
[Bb]Tread softly, [F]tread softly, The [Bb]Master is here;
[Eb]Tread [Bb]softly, [F]tread [C7]softly, He [F]bids [Bb]us [F7]draw near.

Verse 2:
[Bb]Be [F]silent, [Bb]be silent,
[Eb][Bb]For [F][C7]holy [F][Bb]this [F7]place,
[F7][Bb]This [Eb]altar [F][F7]that [Bb]echoes
[Eb][Bb]The [F]message [F7]of [Bb]grace.

Verse 3:
[Bb]Be [F]silent, [Bb]be silent,
[Eb][Bb]Breathe [F][C7]humbly [F][Bb]our [F7]prayer;
[F7][Bb]A [Eb]foretaste [F][F7]of [Bb]Eden
[Eb][Bb]This [F]moment [F7]we [Bb]share.

Verse 4:
[Bb]Be [F]silent, [Bb]be silent,
[Eb][Bb][F]His [C7][F]mercy [Bb][F7]record;
[F7][Bb]Be [Eb]silent, [F][F7]be [Bb]silent,
[Eb]And [Bb]wait [F]on [F7]the [Bb]Lord.
